      "id": "ep-tech-overtime",
      "podcast_id": "pod-tech",
      "title": "工程师该不该把加班当文化",
      "published_date": "2025-03-12",
      "show_notes": "本期主播张三（前云厂商架构师，听众也叫他老张）和嘉宾李明（工程顾问，常被叫作小李）讨论加班。片中提到王总上周在内部会说“不加班就没有产出”，王总并未到场。",
      "private_notes": "这是用户私有备注：不要索引，也不要拿去网页搜索。",
      "transcript_segments": [
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-1",
          "order": 1,
          "speaker_label": "张三",
          "start_ms": 8000,
          "text": "大家好，我是张三，今天请到李明一起聊加班。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-zhangsan-tech",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "self_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-2",
          "order": 2,
          "speaker_label": "李明",
          "start_ms": 18000,
          "text": "我是李明，大家叫我小李也行。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-liming",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "self_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-3",
          "order": 3,
          "speaker_label": "张三",
          "start_ms": 42000,
          "text": "我不赞成无限制加班，长期靠加班堆产出会把团队拖垮。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-zhangsan-tech",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "speaker_label_and_self_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker_label": "李明",
          "start_ms": 61000,
          "text": "我觉得阶段性冲刺可以接受，但那只是发布前几天，不是每周都加班。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-liming",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "speaker_label_and_self_intro"
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker_label": "张三",
          "start_ms": 78000,
          "text": "李明刚才说阶段性冲刺可以接受，我复述一下他的意思：发布窗口允许短冲刺。这是他的观点，不是我的立场。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-zhangsan-tech",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "speaker_label",
          "paraphrase_of_person_id": "person-liming"
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker_label": "张三",
          "start_ms": 99000,
          "text": "难道加班就是唯一出路吗？当然不是。我反对把加班当成文化。",
          "attribution_person_id": "person-zhangsan-tech",
          "attribution_status": "confirmed",
          "attribution_basis": "speaker_label",
          "rhetorical": true
        },
        {
          "id": "ep-tech-overtime:seg-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker_label": "Speaker 2",
          "start_ms": 120000,
          "text": "有人觉得不加班就没有产出，这段说话人标签无法可靠对应到本集嘉宾。",
          "attribution_person_id": "",
          "attribution_status": "pending",
          "attribution_basis": "unmatched_label"
        }
      ],
